{"id":"630533","name":"木耳养心菜拌虾仁","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630533/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊心菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"5只"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"几颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"自己种的养心菜，采一把。","img":"images/630533/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/630533/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/630533/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大蒜切末，放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/630533/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放陈醋。","img":"images/630533/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放生抽和红油拌匀。","img":"images/630533/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"泡好的木耳煮开锅5分钟。","img":"images/630533/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出洗净。","img":"images/630533/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切粗丝。","img":"images/630533/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/630533/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鲜虾洗净开背去虾线，放锅里。","img":"images/630533/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮熟，过冷水。","img":"images/630533/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"去壳摆盘。","img":"images/630533/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"浇上料汁，整理一下即可。","img":"images/630533/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}